alert.dup_id.startup:
Config contains duplicate tunnel ids and cannot start safely.

{exc}

Open the config file, fix the duplicate ids, then restart the app.

alert.dup_id.save:
Config contains duplicate tunnel ids; the change was not saved.

{exc}

Open the config file, fix the duplicate ids, then retry.

alert.dup_id.reload:
Config contains duplicate tunnel ids; the existing connection was kept.

{exc}

Open the config file, fix the duplicate ids, then retry.
